 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "ja-ro": "Watashi, Kumo na Monster wo Tame Shitanode, Spider Silk de Saiho wo Ganbarimasu!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "私、蜘蛛なモンスターをテイムしたので、スパイダーシルクで裁縫を頑張ります！"
   },
   {
    "en": "I've Tamed a Spider Monster, So I'm Going to Try My Best at Sewing with Spider Silk!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "A positive isekai life woven by a cheat-level magical seamstress and her spider partner!\r\n\r\nAfter dying of illness, a young girl named Lily is blessed by a goddess and reincarnated in another world. With a healthy body and the ability of \"Magic Sewing,\" the hopeful Lily encounters a giant magic spider. She tames it and names it \"Tarato.\" That magic spider turned out to be a rare monster that produces valuable threads!?\r\n\r\nWhile enjoying her new life, Lily's clothing made with her \"Magic Sewing\" ability and the rare threads gradually become the talk of the town—!? As she gently polishes her sewing and weaving skills, she works hard every day with the goal of opening her own shop!",
   "ja": "チートな魔法裁縫士と蜘蛛な相棒が紡ぐ、ポジティブ異世界ライフ！\r\n\r\n病死したため女神の祝福を受け異世界に転生した少女・リリィ。健康な身体と『魔法裁縫』の能力を授かって、希望に満ち溢れるリリィが出会ったのはおおきな魔蜘蛛。テイムをして“タラト”と名付けたその魔蜘蛛は希少な糸を生むレアモンスターだった!? 新しい人生を謳歌するリリィですが、『魔法裁縫』の能力×希少な糸でつくった服飾品が次第に話題になって——!?　裁縫＆紡績スキルをゆるゆる磨きつつ、自分のお店を開くため今日も頑張ります！"
  },
